  <header class="m-pad" style="position:relative;max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:88px 48px 0">
    <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(56px,7vw,110px);font-weight:800;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.045em;animation:rise .7s 2s both">Derivatives, on<br><span style="position:relative;display:inline-block;font-family:'PT Serif',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#cd5870">first principles<span style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:6px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5BCEFA,#F5A9B8);transform-origin:left;animation:drawline .8s 2.7s ease both"></span></span><span style="color:#15181d">.</span></h1>
    <div class="m-hero" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;margin-top:38px;animation:rise .7s 2.15s both">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#454b55;max-width:52ch">The clearing engine <em style="font-family:'PT Serif',serif;font-style:italic">is</em> the chain. Matching, cross-asset margin, liquidation and settlement run native on MetaFluxBFT consensus — not as a contract on someone else's L1.</p>
      <div class="m-cta" style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:flex-start">
        <a class="hv5" href="https://app.mtf.exchange/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="background:#15181d;color:#faf9f5;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Open the devnet →</a>
        <a class="hv6" href="whitepaper.html" style="border:1.5px solid #15181d;color:#15181d;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Whitepaper</a>
