  <section id="risk" data-screen-label="Risk" class="m-pad m-sec" style="position:relative;max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:110px 48px 0">
    <div style="animation:rise linear both;animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 5% entry 35%">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <span style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#cd5870">§ 01 / RISK</span>
        <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(32px,3.4vw,44px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em">One number, not three.</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="height:1.5px;background:#15181d;margin:18px 0 0"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="m-risk" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;border:1.5px solid #15181d;border-top:none;animation:rise linear both;animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 10% entry 45%">
      <div style="padding:32px;border-right:1.5px solid #15181d">
        <div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#8a8f98;margin-bottom:14px">SPEC</div>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#454b55">A SPAN-style scenario engine values your whole book at once, so a hedge stops paying margin twice. Same three positions, same equity — only the maintenance margin moves.</p>
