        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#454b55">Your contract call does not queue behind a market it never touches. Derivatives precompiles — <b style="color:#15181d">portfolio margin, ADL pricing, RFQ depth, vault NAV</b> — run native rather than as 80,000-gas Solidity.</p>
      </div>
