        <div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#0a5f86;margin-bottom:12px">MATCHING OTHER CHAINS HAVEN'T SHIPPED</div>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#454b55">A central limit order book with self-trade prevention, plus <b style="color:#15181d">RFQ</b> for size that shouldn't advertise and <b style="color:#15181d">frequent batch auctions</b> where fairness beats latency. Intent is encrypted at intake and revealed at settlement.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:#8a8f98">CLOB + STP · RFQ · FBA · MEV-RESISTANT INTAKE</div>
      </div>
