        <div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#0a5f86;margin-bottom:12px">METAFLUXBFT CONSENSUS</div>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#454b55">A <b style="color:#15181d">2-chain BFT</b> protocol with a stake-weighted leader, optimistic execution, and quorum and timeout certificates at two-thirds stake.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:30px 32px">
        <div style="font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#0a5f86;margin-bottom:12px">SETTLEMENT IN THE BLOCK</div>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#454b55">Sixteen begin-block effects, a weighted-median oracle mark, funding, and an <b style="color:#15181d">LtHash16</b> state commitment folded into the app hash every block.</p>
